      "sc:description": "SEAGALL is a deep learning pipeline that uses geometry-regularised autoencoders (GRAE) and explainable graph attention networks (X-GAT) to analyze single-cell data. It quantifies molecular features to explain cell identity and extract stable signatures from multiomics experiments.",
